        <input-field type="bool">
            <name>FreightTaxable</name>
            <defaultValue>true</defaultValue>
            <label>Freight is taxable?</label>
            <label lang="zh-CN">运费是否征税？</label>
            <label lang="zh-TW">運費是否徵稅？</label>
            <label lang="zh-HK">運費是否徵税？</label>
            <label lang="de-DE">Fracht ist steuerpflichtig?</label>
            <label lang="fr-FR">Le fret est-il taxable?</label>
            <label lang="en-US">Freight is taxable?</label>
        </input-field>

        <input-field type="int">
            <name>TaxDecimals</name>
            <defaultValue>2</defaultValue>
            <label>Tax Decimals</label>
            <label lang="zh-CN">税额小数位数</label>
            <label lang="zh-TW">稅額小數位數</label>
            <label lang="zh-HK">税額小數位數</label>
            <label lang="de-DE">Steuerdezimalzahlen</label>
            <label lang="fr-FR">Décimales fiscales</label>
            <label lang="en-US">Tax Decimals</label>
            <helpText>Number of decimals tax amounts are rounded to. Values below 2 are raised to 2 and above 4 are capped at 4.</helpText>
            <helpText lang="zh-CN">税额四舍五入保留的小数位数。小于 2 按 2 处理，大于 4 按 4 处理。</helpText>
            <helpText lang="zh-TW">稅額四捨五入保留的小數位數。小於 2 按 2 處理，大於 4 按 4 處理。</helpText>
            <helpText lang="zh-HK">税額四捨五入保留的小數位數。小於 2 按 2 處理，大於 4 按 4 處理。</helpText>
            <helpText lang="en-US">Number of decimals tax amounts are rounded to. Values below 2 are raised to 2 and above 4 are capped at 4.</helpText>
        </input-field>

        <input-field type="float">
            <name>TaxGstFederal</name>
            <defaultValue>5</defaultValue>
            <label>Federal GST</label>
            <label lang="zh-CN">联邦 GST</label>
            <label lang="zh-TW">聯邦 GST</label>
            <label lang="zh-HK">聯邦 GST</label>
            <label lang="de-DE">Bundesweite GST</label>
            <label lang="fr-FR">TPS fédérale</label>
            <label lang="en-US">Federal GST</label>
            <helpText>Federal GST rate applied to "(CA) GST only" products in HST provinces, which have no separate provincial GST field.</helpText>
            <helpText lang="zh-CN">在 HST 省份对「(CA) 仅 GST」商品适用的联邦 GST 税率（这些省份没有单独的 GST 字段）。</helpText>
            <helpText lang="zh-TW">在 HST 省份對「(CA) 僅 GST」商品適用的聯邦 GST 稅率（這些省份沒有單獨的 GST 字段）。</helpText>
            <helpText lang="zh-HK">在 HST 省份對「(CA) 僅 GST」商品適用的聯邦 GST 税率（這些省份沒有單獨的 GST 字段）。</helpText>
            <helpText lang="en-US">Federal GST rate applied to "(CA) GST only" products in HST provinces, which have no separate provincial GST field.</helpText>
        </input-field>
